=== ChromaLink blur-gate measurement evidence, 2026-08-09T10:54:20Z ===
Command: npx vitest run test/blur-evidence.test.ts --disable-console-intercept

Method: N100 frames rendered at 6 px/module, captured through the normal
720x720 synthetic path with full phase-3 distortion, box blur applied last
(defocused optics blur the already-noisy sensor image). Sharpness is the
production 160 px downscale Laplacian deviation; SHARPNESS_MIN = 25.

N100, phase-3 distortion (rot ±8°, corners ±4%, σ8 noise, ±20 brightness), blur applied last:
  blur= 0@720px (12 trials): decode=100%  sharpness(160px gate)=[231.5..244.1]  gate SHARPNESS_MIN=25
  blur= 2@720px (12 trials): decode=100%  sharpness(160px gate)=[140.0..148.6]  gate SHARPNESS_MIN=25
  blur= 3@720px (40 trials): decode= 88%  sharpness(160px gate)=[91.4..102.6]  gate SHARPNESS_MIN=25
  blur= 4@720px (12 trials): decode=  0%  sharpness(160px gate)=[60.5..67.7]  gate SHARPNESS_MIN=25
  blur= 5@720px (12 trials): decode=  0%  sharpness(160px gate)=[42.4..46.7]  gate SHARPNESS_MIN=25
  blur= 6@720px (12 trials): decode=  0%  sharpness(160px gate)=[33.1..35.5]  gate SHARPNESS_MIN=25
  blur= 8@720px (12 trials): decode=  0%  sharpness(160px gate)=[22.9..25.2]  gate SHARPNESS_MIN=25
  blur=10@720px (12 trials): decode=  0%  sharpness(160px gate)=[17.2..18.6]  gate SHARPNESS_MIN=25
